    "source": "Upload and @rc-component/upload 1.1.1 AjaxUploader/traverseFileTree",
    "observation": "Callback FileSystemEntry boundary is controlled by the fixture adapter; Source traversal is unmodified. Raw breadth-first order, repeated readEntries batches, relative paths, accept, picker, paste/drop and directory errors. file-error records missing error callback: after a controlled failed read Source has no beforeUpload/onChange and never reads the following good file. Native must settle file failures and keep remaining files, preserving the Source healthy path. A separate public sample without the unreadable entry follows all raw cases; only recovered file metadata uses that counterpart. Input attributes retain Source strings; boolean property is measured separately."
